{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2022-10-04 05:00:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL CATALYST PRODUCTION EXPANSION ADDS LIFE TO INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS', 'text': 'FRANKFURT, GERMANY , OCT. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL TODAY ANNOUNCES THE START-UP OF A NEW CATALYST PRODUCTION PLANT AT ITS FRANKFURT, GERMANY, SITE. THIS ANNOUNCEMENT DIRECTLY CORRELATES TO INVESTMENTS IN INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS, INCREASED DEMAND FOR POLYMERS BY A GROWING POPULATION, PARTICULARLY IN EMERGING COUNTRIES\xa0AND THE VALUE OF OUR HOSTALEN ACP POLYETHYLENE (PE) TECHNOLOGY.'}